            "Honestly, an excellent system, very easy to use, and the technical support is excellent. I've tried more than one program, but this one really is excellent, and Eng. Omar is great to deal with.",
            "", "",
            "كريم النجار", "Kareem Elnaggar",
            "naggar-shop.jpg", "50% 40%", "واجهة النجار ماركت", "The El Naggar Market storefront",
            "naggar-system.jpg", "50% 35%", "فاتورة يعمل على كاشير النجار ماركت", "Fatora running at the El Naggar Market counter"),

